@startuml Health Assistant Core Activities Sequence Diagram
!theme plain
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #E8F5E8
  BorderColor #4CAF50
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
  BorderColor #1976D2
}

title Health Assistant System - Core Activities Sequence Diagram

actor Patient as P
actor Doctor as D
participant System as S
participant Database as DB
participant AI as AI

== Activity 1: Patient Registration ==
P -> S: Register with details
S -> DB: Save patient data
DB -> S: Registration successful
S -> P: Account created

== Activity 2: Patient Upload Report ==
P -> S: Login
S -> P: Dashboard
P -> S: Upload medical report
S -> DB: Store report
DB -> S: Report saved
S -> P: Upload successful

== Activity 3: AI Symptom Check ==
P -> S: Enter symptoms
S -> AI: Analyze symptoms
AI -> S: Health recommendations
S -> P: Show AI advice

== Activity 4: Doctor Review Patient ==
D -> S: Login as doctor
S -> DB: Get patient list
DB -> S: Patient data
S -> D: Show patients
D -> S: Select patient
S -> DB: Get patient reports
DB -> S: Report details
S -> D: Display patient info

== Activity 5: Doctor Create Diagnosis ==
D -> S: Create diagnosis
S -> DB: Save diagnosis
DB -> S: Diagnosis saved
S -> D: Success message
S -> P: Notify patient

@enduml